---
/**
 * Redesign "Command palette" (routes /v9/ and /es/v9/).
 * The portfolio as a modern developer tool: a live command palette in the hero (and on
 * ⌘K / Ctrl+K / "/" anywhere) that searches every section, the design method as a
 * pipeline run with an inspector, the career as a release changelog, projects as
 * repository cards and skills as a settings panel. Standalone page: it does not load the
 * main site's JS or Tailwind.
 */
